fc-images = The game and, when signed in to chat with card previews enabled, chat card previews show unaltered card images from Scryfall with artist credit. No card images are loaded on public pages or for Universes Beyond prints. Card data and images are provided by Scryfall, and Baylee is not affiliated with Scryfall.
